      "body": "Fortis Malar Hospitals Limited announced that based on the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee of the Company, the Board of Directors of the Company through circular resolution, had approved the appointment of Mr. Bidesh Chandra Paul (DIN: 08596135) as an Additional Director (Non-Independent) of the Company effective from January 18, 2026 (close of business hours). Mr. Chandrasekar Ramaswamy (DIN: 09414564) had resigned from the directorship of the Company, was serving as Whole Time Director and KMP as well (Executive & Non-Independent Director) and accordingly, ceased to be Director of the Company effective from January 18, 2026 (close of business hours). Mr. Bidesh Chandra Paul is a healthcare and operations leader with over 15 years of experience in manufacturing",
